<title>USA: Boyd Gaming completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Boyd Gaming completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boyd Gaming Corp said on Thursday it completed the acquisition of Par-A-Dice Gaming Corp, owner and operator of the Par-A-Dice Riverboat Casino and a recently completed 208-room luxury hotel in East Peoria, Illinois.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
